  "details": "When running VRChat without Steam, pressing F12 to take a screenshot in Third Person mode will only take a screenshot from the player avatar's head position, seemingly lacking world-defined camera components like post-processing. (In first-person mode, it works as expected.)\n\nThis occurs regardless of whether the camera is locked or orbiting, and can be obstructed by parts of the avatar's head and eyes.\n\nAttached: Actual outcome (taken with F12) vs expected outcome (taken via Windows Snipping Tool)",
